		(date "2026-10-19")
		(rev "A")
		(company "TAS5806M Bluetooth soundbar")
		(comment 1 "VOUT = 1.204 V x (1 + 316k/47k) = 9.30 V; fsw ~550 kHz (RFREQ 270k); ILIM 8.1 A typ (68k, PFM)")
		(comment 2 "EN low = switching off; PVDD then sits at VSYS - body diode (TPS61088 has no output disconnect)")
		(comment 3 "Loop: R5 100k / C5 10n, C8 DNP. Verify with a load-step test before connecting speakers")
